direction: down
style.fill: "#17181b"
vars: { d2-config: { pad: 20 } }
*.style: { font-size: 20; bold: false; fill: "#23252a"; stroke: "#747a85"; font-color: "#f2f3f5"; border-radius: 8 }
(* -> *)[*].style: { stroke: "#ff9b55"; font-color: "#f2f3f5"; font-size: 16 }
host: Authorised agent host\nChosen workspace and account
core: Get Ready core\nDetect • prepare • verify • resume
providers: Supported tools\nGitHub CLI • Wrangler • Git
proof: Dated evidence\nPrivate receipt • redacted report
host -> core: library / CLI / local MCP
core -> providers: scoped checks and operations
providers -> proof: source and HTTPS verification
proof -> core: recheck on resume
